FAIL C8-incorrect-assumption — no governed path produces a 'incorrect-assumption' failure record: 'gov memory miss' records only retrieval misses, and the product's only other writers are tool-failure and regression; the kind exists in the KINDS constant and in the schema only
FAIL C8-migration-failure — no governed path produces a 'migration-failure' failure record: 'gov memory miss' records only retrieval misses, and the product's only other writers are tool-failure and regression; the kind exists in the KINDS constant and in the schema only
PASS C8-durable — failure memory survives deletion and full rebuild of derived state (kinds before=[retrieval-miss tool-failure] after=[retrieval-miss tool-failure])
PASS C8-not-indexed — a recorded retrieval miss is never itself returned as the answer to the query it records
